<title>USA: GranCare sets payment date for spinoff div.</title>
<headline>GranCare sets payment date for spinoff div.</headline>
<dateline>ATLANTA 1997-01-31</dateline>
<text>
<p>GranCare Inc said it has set a record date of the close of business February 12 for a stock dividend to be paid to shareholders as part of the spinoff of its subsidiary, New GranCare Inc.</p>
<p>Shareholders of record as of that date will be entitled to receive one share of New GranCare common stock for each share of GranCare common stock owned.</p>
<p>Under the deal, GranCare's institutional pharmacy business is merging with and into Vitalink Pharmacy Services Inc. After the deal is completed, New GranCare will change its name to GranCare, and will operate GranCare's historical businesses other than its institutional pharmacy businesses.</p>
</text>
